<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f7f6; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a3f17, #31572c); padding: 36px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; }
    .body p { color: #374151; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a3f17, #31572c); color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; margin: 24px 0; }
    .note { background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #31572c; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 24px; }
    .footer { background: #f9fafb; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🎓 EduCore LMS</h1>
      <p>Password Reset Request</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset your EduCore LMS password. Click the button below to create a new password:</p>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{resetLink}}" class="button">Reset My Password</a>
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        ⏱ This link expires in <strong>{{expiresIn}}</strong>. If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      EduCore LMS · This is an automated message, please do not reply.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
